sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as QML
  participant App
  participant DB as SQLite cache
  participant Api as TodoApi
  participant G as Microsoft Graph
  UI->>App: select list
  App->>DB: tasks(list)
  DB-->>App: cached tasks
  App-->>UI: show immediately
  alt delta link stored
    App->>Api: syncTasks(list, deltaLink)
    Api->>G: GET deltaLink (follows @odata.nextLink)
    G-->>Api: changed + @removed, new deltaLink
    Api-->>App: tasksDelta
    App->>DB: applyTaskDelta + setDeltaLink
  else no delta link / HTTP 410
    App->>Api: fetchTasks(list)
    Api->>G: GET /tasks?$expand=checklistItems,linkedResources (all pages)
    G-->>Api: tasks
    App->>DB: upsertTasks (replace list)
    App->>Api: bootstrapDeltaLink
  end
  App-->>UI: refreshed model
